  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ytdlp.NET\n\n\t\t\t✨ Features\n\t\t\t- Add yt-dlp probe argument support\n\t\t\tAllow custom arguments to be passed to metadata probing operations, providing greater flexibility for authentication, extraction, and other yt-dlp options.\n\t\t\t- Add yt-dlp livestream progress support\n\t\t\tParse and report livestream progress with elapsed time and optional fragment information.\n\t\t\tAdd live-progress handling without ETA or completion status.\n\n\t\t\t🛠 Notes\n\t\t\t- Companion packages recommended: ManuHub.Ytdlp, ManuHub.FFmpeg, ManuHub.FFprobe, ManuHub.Deno.\n\t\t\t- This release greatly improves reliability, cancellation, and maintainability.\n\t\t\t- All examples and documentation updated.\n\n\t\t\tSee the repository for the full documentation and migration guide.",
